OL,3,GNEWSASarah Montgomery's murder was a
OL,4,A'coldblooded and sustained' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man beat his pregnant partner and the
OL,7,Fmother of his two children to death
OL,8,Fusing a water bottle that had been
OL,9,Fgiven to him as a Father's Day present,
OL,10,Fa court in Belfast has heard.
OL,12,FSarah Montgomery, 27, was 32 weeks
OL,13,Fpregnant when she was murdered by Zak
OL,14,FHughes in June 2025.
OL,16,FShe had two other children, both girls,
OL,17,Faged five and seven.
OL,19,FHughes, 29, from Ardglen Place in
OL,20,FArdoyne, Belfast pleaded guilty to her
OL,21,Fmurder and to a charge of child
OL,22,Fdestruction in June 2026.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
